      "review_description": "I received 10+ quotes and after a detailed evaluation decided to progress with Solbase.The sales/quoting process was smooth and pricing was competitive.The installers professional and polite and spent time to help connect my inverter app.The Solbase team had my Solar system installed yesterday. The system is working well and the sales to installation process was overall very smoothe. Also the owner visited on the installation day to say hi and check everything progressing well which was a nice touch.",
