      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quote process was good with a wide range of price options. In general most providers were offering combinations of the same equipment so the choice came down to price and confidence in the installation and customer service.Solbase provided the lowest price. I requested to speak to their installer on site before selecting. The installer provided excellent answers to my questions, had over 700 installation jobs and also appreciated the need for care in avoiding roof damage during the installation. Based on this factors I selected Solbase. On the day the team were really good. They took care to make sure the installation was carefully undertaken and aesthetically pleasing. I am happy to say that the job went well. It was completed in about 4 hours without damage or incident. The panels look great and are working well. The wireless inverter app is easy to use and provides sufficient information for my needs. Overall I am very happy with the process and outcome.",
